/ActualText (Jessamine finds transformed input features to feed into XGBoost in order to capture non-linear relationships. The plot demonstrates XGBoost limitation - requiring an uninterpretable design using 8 decision trees, 4 depth, and a complex decision boundary that will not generalize as well. )
