/ActualText (Jessamine underperforms in terms of accuracy for some real-world datasets as it is still in the early stages of development. We found the most important predictors are Oldpeak \(ST depression induced by exercise relative to rest, indicating heart disease severity\), MaxHR \(maximum heart rate achieved during exercise, reflecting cardiovascular fitness\), and ExerciseAngina \(exercise-induced chest pain, a strong indicator of coronary artery disease\).)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [23]
